# A photo and a file from ＋'s sheet (文件; MBUI_PICK_FILES answers the panel), each put up in parts at once, then sent.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap icon:plus
until =文件
shot 1-sheet
tap =文件
until e2e-data.bin
shot 2-picked
timeout 180000
gone 正在上传
shot 3-uploaded
timeout 60000
tap 发消息
type 一张照片和一个文件 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 一张照片和一个文件 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 4-sent
